WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.216
Conference Management System. Run your academic conference in one place.

00:00:06.116 --> 00:00:13.988
From a public home page listing every conference, to a full event page with dates, tracks, and a live programme.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:18.760
Authors submit. Reviewers review, blind.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:28.188
Authors sign in, write an abstract, attach their paper, and submit - no email back and forth, just a tracked submission with its own code.

00:00:30.411 --> 00:00:36.747
Reviewers see the paper, never the author's name, and submit a structured review in minutes.

00:00:39.123 --> 00:00:46.539
The convenor's dashboard surfaces exactly what needs attention - here, a reviewed paper ready for a decision.

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:54.931
Accepted papers get dropped straight into the programme grid, and the public page updates the moment it's published.

00:00:55.931 --> 00:01:00.539
Attendees register. Staff check them in.

00:01:00.439 --> 00:01:06.271
Registering takes under a minute, and ends with a ticket - Q R code included.

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:12.815
At the door, staff search, tap check in, and the count updates live.

00:01:13.815 --> 00:01:18.039
Certificates, generated and released in one click.

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:26.627
With a branded template already in place, the convenor generates certificates for every checked in attendee and releases them at once.

00:01:27.627 --> 00:01:32.883
Attendees download a real P D F certificate straight from their portal.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:49.534
Every certificate carries a Q R code that verifies it instantly - and if the convenor ever needs to revoke one, that shows up immediately too.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:56.390
And across every conference, a platform dashboard keeps an eye on system health.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:05.358
Conference Management System. Abstracts, reviews, programme, registration, certificates.
